  "ruleText": "PART Ins 2703 EXTERNAL REVIEW\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 400-A:15 and RSA 420-J:12\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #14595, effective 5-22-26, repealed Section Ins 2703.06 in Part Ins 2703, titled “Expedited External Review”, and adopted new text. Document #14595, effective 5-22-26, also repealed Section Ins 2703.08 in Part Ins 2703, titled “External Review Reporting Requirements”, and adopted new text.",
